10
00:01:28.550 --> 00:01:30.699
Luca | Vero: Like reorgs or non-finality.

11
00:01:32.450 --> 00:01:37.180
Luca | Vero: So, that's… that's probably the only concern that I've heard. Otherwise.

12
00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:41.630
Luca | Vero: Is there any other concern?

13
00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:53.280
Luca | Vero: Okay, guess not. So…

14
00:01:53.280 --> 00:01:55.410
