74
00:08:35.220 --> 00:08:36.899
Potuz: Well, yeah.

75
00:08:37.070 --> 00:08:41.619
Potuz: Changing the validator client to do this is a big change.

76
00:08:41.860 --> 00:08:53.760
Potuz: And it makes the validator client more fragile, therefore, which is something that we want to keep lean, we want to keep small. And actually, I want to hear Nico, because Nico implemented this, and he has already some concerns.

77
00:08:55.640 --> 00:09:00.709
