83
00:09:28.070 --> 00:09:28.680
Luca | Vero: Yeah.

84
00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:39.550
Enrico Del Fante: Yeah, like, fixing the bid, and we probably need to do the validation of the bid online in that case. It's just a fixed way of saying, produce this block with this bid.

85
00:09:41.530 --> 00:09:43.949
Luca | Vero: Yes, and the Beacon Hour has full.

